<tr>
<td colspan=12 >
      <br>
      Requirements to join the Lore Keepers:<br>
      <br>
      Must be of the 12th circle of power. Your email will be made available
      to the officers within the guild. We accept any race any class and any alignment so long as you realize the
      need to protect the guild.<br>
      <br>
      If you are interested in joining us, please fill out this form: 
      <form action="/cgi-bin/loremail.asp" method="post">			
         <table cellspacing="2" cellpadding="2" border="0">
            <tr>
               <td>
                  Your Email:
               </td>
               <td>
                  <input type="text" name="email" size="40">
               </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
               <td>
                  Name of your Character:
               </td>
               <td>
                  <input type="text" name="name" size="40">
               </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
               <td>
                  Race:
               </td>
               <td>
                  <select name="race">
                     <option value="Barbarian">
                        Barbarian
                     </option>
                     <option value="Darkelf">
                        Darkelf
                     </option>
                     <option value="Dwarf">
                        Dwarf
                     </option>
                     <option value="Erudite">
                        Erudite
                     </option>
                     <option value="Gnome">
                        Gnome
                     </option>
                     <option value="Halfelf">
                        Halfelf
                     </option>
                     <option value="Halfling">
                        Halfling
                     </option>
                     <option value="Highelf">
                        Highelf
                     </option>
                     <option value="Human">
                        Human
                     </option>
                     <option value="Ogre">
                        Ogre
                     </option>
                     <option value="Troll">
                        Troll
                     </option>
                     <option value="Woodelf">
                        Woodelf
                     </option>
                  </select>
               </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
               <td>
                  Class:
               </td>
               <td>
                  <select name="charClass">
                     <option value="Bard">
                        Bard
                     </option>
                     <option value="Cleric">
                        Cleric
                     </option>
                     <option value="Druid">
                        Druid
                     </option>
                     <option value="Enchanter">
                        Enchanter
                     </option>
                     <option value="Magician">
                        Magician
                     </option>
                     <option value="Monk">
                        Monk
                     </option>
                     <option value="Necromancer">
                        Necromancer
                     </option>
                     <option value="Ranger">
                        Ranger
                     </option>
                     <option value="Paladin">
                        Paladin
                     </option>
                     <option value="Rogue">
                        Rogue
                     </option>
                     <option value="Shadowknight">
                        Shadowknight
                     </option>
                     <option value="Shaman">
                        Shaman
                     </option>
                     <option value="Warrior">
                        Warrior
                     </option>
                     <option value="Wizard">
                        Wizard
                     </option>
                  </select>
               </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
               <td>
                  Your current Level:
               </td>
               <td>
                  <input type="text" name="Level" size="3">(You should be at least level 12!!)
               </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
               <td>
                  Yor alignment:
               </td>
               <td>
                  <select name="alignment">
                     <option value="Good">
                        Good
                     </option>
                     <option value="Neutral">
                        Neutral
                     </option>
                     <option value="Evil">
                        Evil
                     </option>
                  </select>
               </td>
            </tr>
         </table>
         <br>
         Please give a short description of your character:<br>
         <textarea cols="60" rows="4" name="Char_Desc">
         </textarea><br>
         <br>
         What about the Lore Keepers caught your interest?<br>
         <textarea cols="60" rows="4" name="Interest">
         </textarea><br>
         <br>
         Have you in the past, adventured with any current member of the Lore
         Keepers?<br>
         <input type="radio" name="Adv_w_Lorekeepers" value="Yes" checked
         >Yes    <input type="radio" name="Adv_w_Lorekeepers" value="No">No    
         If yes, who? <input type="text" name="known_membrs" size="60"
         maxlength="255"><br>
         <br>
         Anything else you wish us to know about you or your character?
         <textarea cols="60" rows="4" name="Other">
         </textarea><br>
         <br>
          
         <table>
            <tr>
               <td>
                  <input type="submit" value="Send Message">
               </td>
               <td>
                  <input type="reset" value="Clear Form">
               </td>
            </tr>
